			"notes": "- `G` now reads the flying eye, and `Shift+G` takes the ray from your aim.\n- Crossings outside every stronghold ring are dim grey-red on the map and in the pair list. They still count toward the average point.\n- An average point outside every ring is red on the map, in the result panel and as the minimap waypoint.\n- Rays are numbered 1, 2, 3 with no gaps. Deleting a ray moves every later ray down by one, and colors follow the new numbers."
		},
