			"notes": "`Shift+G` now works on every server and never moves the camera. It reads where the flying eye is on two neighboring ticks. Press it within about 1.5 seconds after the throw; later, the mod says it didn't see the eye.\n\nWith Xaero's Minimap installed (optional), a gold waypoint marks the stronghold and moves by itself when the throws change.\n\nInstall this jar with Fabric API and Xaero's World Map `1.47.x`. Saves from older versions still load. See the README for how to use it."
